1
00:00:22,789 --> 00:00:26,673
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,073 --> 00:00:33,688
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,561 --> 00:00:40,699
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,037 --> 00:00:47,046
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,257 --> 00:00:51,178
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,389 --> 00:00:54,480
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,777 --> 00:00:59,012
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:00,997 --> 00:01:03,905
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,203 --> 00:01:07,089
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,399 --> 00:01:12,181
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,181 --> 00:01:16,761
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,761 --> 00:01:18,760
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,963 --> 00:01:24,745
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,129 --> 00:01:29,440
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,948
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,194 --> 00:01:42,411
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,861 --> 00:01:48,695
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,695 --> 00:01:51,613
=Episode 17=

19
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:07,359
M-Miss Bai,
I haven't finished bathing yet.

20
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,360
Could you please leave?

21
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:14,759
Miss Bai,

22
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,520
don't come any closer.

23
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,400
I don't have anything on.

24
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,800
Are you scared?

25
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,919
O-Of course not.

26
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,840
It's not like I'm naked.

27
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,000
You need not be so nervous.

28
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,400
Miss Bai, this is truly improper.

29
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,800
Please step out.

30
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:47,120
But I won't do anything to you.

31
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:52,560
I just want to wash your back for you.

32
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,959
Young Master Xu,

33
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:21,959
what is this?

34
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,639
You can't escape my grasp.

35
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:05,040
After ten years,
you've finally shown up.

36
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,439
I will hunt you down.

37
00:05:09,759 --> 00:05:10,759
Who is it?

38
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,839
The enemy

39
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,759
who killed my parents.

40
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,519
Young Master Xu,

41
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:23,560
what is this?

42
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:39,079
It's good.

43
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,600
Stop struggling.

44
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,240
You can't get out.

45
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,439
Being absorbed by me
is only a matter of time.

46
00:06:18,319 --> 00:06:19,639
You should have seen it.

47
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:23,079
The dowry Aunt gave me was so beautiful.

48
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,199
Why is everyone so nice to you?

49
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,399
No,

50
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,519
now they are nice to me.

51
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:37,519
Miss Bai, are you inside?

52
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,800
I'm here.

53
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:57,360
Miss Bai, there's something
I want to ask you.

54
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,800
Are you here to talk about our wedding?

55
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,560
N-No.

56
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:21,000
We can talk about that later.

57
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
I wanted to ask you,

58
00:07:22,879 --> 00:07:24,439
do you really not remember this?

59
00:07:27,079 --> 00:07:28,439
Of course I do.

60
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:32,120
But it doesn't matter.

61
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:35,639
You are what matters.

62
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,399
No. She isn't me.

63
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,199
Miss Bai, I need to go.

64
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,560
See?

65
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:05,000
He can't tell us apart at all.

66
00:08:06,399 --> 00:08:09,120
I'll win him over sooner or later.

67
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:12,079
It's just a matter of time.

68
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,800
Here.

69
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,759
My embroidered ball!

70
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,720
Amazing!

71
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,600
Amazing!

72
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:59,519
This little thing is quite fun.

73
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,080
What is this?

74
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:03,240
The embroidered ball
my younger sister gave me.

75
00:09:04,399 --> 00:09:05,559
An embroidered ball?

76
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,799
Good, it's mine now.

77
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,039
Give me back my ball!

78
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,960
- Give me back my ball!
- Give me back my ball!

79
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,799
- Give me back my ball!
- Give me back my ball!

80
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,480
Give me back my ball!

81
00:09:19,879 --> 00:09:20,879
Give me back my ball!

82
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:22,240
All right, no more fuss.

83
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:23,639
Here, take this.

84
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,080
It could buy you several balls.

85
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:53,039
Suzhen, Suzhen.

86
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,039
Suzhen.

87
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,600
Suzhen,

88
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,399
guess what fun new thing I brought you.

89
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:10,519
What is it?

90
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,080
Take a guess.

91
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,399
I really can't guess.

92
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:17,960
An embroidered ball.

93
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:21,879
In the mortal realm, this is given
to children as a blessing,

94
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:24,000
a plaything for their spare time.

95
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,639
I'm giving it to you now.

96
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,039
Shall we play together?

97
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,440
Alright, I'll take it.

98
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,679
Suzhen, let's play together for a bit.

99
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:37,960
Qing, I have things to do right now.

100
00:10:38,399 --> 00:10:40,440
I'll play with you
when I have time, alright?

101
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,120
Suzhen.

102
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:47,919
Be good, Qing.

103
00:10:49,279 --> 00:10:52,440
Suzhen, just play with me
for a little while, please?

104
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,440
Qing.

105
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,720
Could you stop bothering me?

106
00:11:19,799 --> 00:11:20,799
Fine.

107
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:38,120
Do you really not remember this?

108
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,360
Of course I do.

109
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:45,399
But it doesn't matter.

110
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,240
Are you scared?

111
00:11:53,639 --> 00:11:57,480
I just want to wash your back for you.

112
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:04,000
(Is she really my Suzhen?)

113
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,320
It's Xu Xian again.

114
00:12:12,559 --> 00:12:15,039
All she thinks about now is Xu Xian.

115
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,039
There's no room left for me.

116
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:21,360
But she did say I was the only one.

117
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,960
Why did she learn
those bad habits from humans?

118
00:12:28,519 --> 00:12:30,240
I just can't accept it.

119
00:12:31,559 --> 00:12:33,960
She chose love
over friendship. I get it.

120
00:12:35,559 --> 00:12:36,559
You don't get it.

121
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:39,159
I'm supposed to be the most important.

122
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:43,279
I just wanted to play
with her a bit longer.

123
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,240
What did I do wrong?

124
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,360
You did nothing wrong.

125
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,679
It's all his fault.

126
00:12:50,159 --> 00:12:51,159
Seriously. You know what?

127
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:52,759
If I knew how to shapeshift,

128
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:55,480
I'd turn him into a dog, alright?

129
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,440
Or turn him into a wooden post
and make him...

130
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,679
- That's your idea?
- Stand right here.

131
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,679
Scold him all you want.

132
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,399
I'll let you be the older sister.

133
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,320
Nonsense.

134
00:13:12,519 --> 00:13:13,519
You don't get it.

135
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:14,559
You have no idea.

136
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,720
You're annoying.

137
00:13:23,679 --> 00:13:25,080
You're upset if I don't talk

138
00:13:25,519 --> 00:13:27,159
and even more upset if I talk too much.

139
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,080
Unbelievable.

140
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,080
Miss Bai,

141
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:14,480
Miss Qing

142
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,960
hasn't been in the best mood lately.

143
00:14:16,559 --> 00:14:18,600
I think you should
find time to talk to her

144
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,600
and cheer her up.

145
00:14:20,279 --> 00:14:24,120
You came all this way
just to blame me for neglecting Qing?

146
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:26,879
I'm not blaming you.

147
00:14:27,919 --> 00:14:29,480
The sisterly bond between you two

148
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,480
is beyond me anyway.

149
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:36,679
I know Miss Qing respects and loves you.

150
00:14:37,799 --> 00:14:39,559
You're her only family, truly.

151
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,600
You mean a lot to her.

152
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,639
She means a lot to me too.

153
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:52,360
Exactly, which is why
you should care for her more.

154
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:56,279
After over five centuries of cultivation

155
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:59,080
and finally a chance
to achieve immortality,

156
00:14:59,879 --> 00:15:01,720
do you think it matters to me or not?

157
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,679
Qing does matter, of course,

158
00:15:12,399 --> 00:15:14,000
but there are priorities.

159
00:15:17,279 --> 00:15:18,279
Little Master Fahai,

160
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:23,720
you understand this, don't you?

161
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:28,440
I do. I do.

162
00:16:42,875 --> 00:16:47,034
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

163
00:16:49,501 --> 00:16:53,879
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

164
00:16:55,422 --> 00:17:01,247
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

165
00:17:02,016 --> 00:17:06,483
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

166
00:17:09,348 --> 00:17:13,789
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

167
00:17:15,985 --> 00:17:20,715
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

168
00:17:21,927 --> 00:17:28,040
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

169
00:17:28,703 --> 00:17:34,485
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

170
00:17:34,485 --> 00:17:40,748
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

171
00:17:41,058 --> 00:17:47,417
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

172
00:17:47,588 --> 00:17:54,955
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

173
00:17:55,240 --> 00:18:00,787
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

174
00:18:01,278 --> 00:18:07,488
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

175
00:18:07,798 --> 00:18:14,571
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

176
00:18:15,568 --> 00:18:21,221
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

177
00:18:22,055 --> 00:18:26,463
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

178
00:18:27,228 --> 00:18:29,816
♪Having ever loved♪
